<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, inflation.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, inflation.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD   PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					DATA		     DATE</p>
<p>  Steel output	1996     n/a		     Jan 29-30</p>
<p>  Trade balance     Nov     +11.1 bln, c/a -1.3  Jan 30-31</p>
<p>  Inflation, prelim Jan     +0.3 m/m, +1.4 y/y   Jan 30-31</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
